# agent2kb PROJECT-LEVEL pointer
# Location: <your-project>/.kb/config.yaml   (`a2kb new <name> --here` writes it)
#
# It only says which KB from your user-level config this folder uses, so `a2kb` works here
# (and in subfolders) without -p. It holds no secrets and is safe to commit.
#
# Do NOT put credentials in a project file. If one ever carries access_key, secret_key or an
# API key, keep it out of version control (add `.kb/` to .gitignore) and move the secrets to
# ~/.kb/config.yaml: agent2kb refuses a pointer that contains them.
kb: research
